QNPruner release

- qnpruner/ : QNPruner token selection (this work).
- llava/, scripts/eval/eval_*.sh, pyproject.toml : derived from LLaVA-3D (https://github.com/ZCMax/LLaVA-3D),
  which is distributed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International License
  (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/). These files are modified (an external
  token-selection hook via method_registry, the question text and LLM embedding table handed to the video tower,
  compact evaluation loops) and are redistributed under the same license. LLaVA-3D itself builds on LLaVA (Apache-2.0).
- scripts/eval/score_openeqa.py : OpenEQA LLM-Match scoring following open-eqa's evaluate-predictions.py
  (https://github.com/facebookresearch/open-eqa), which it imports at run time.
- determinism/ : deterministic-kernel settings used to reproduce the reported numbers.

No datasets, annotations, features or model weights are included.
